"-1\"><span class=\"HWr-d\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div type=\"paragraph\" data-hook=\"rcv-block29\"></div><div data-breakout=\"normal\"><p class=\"n58GL wgYGg _3ea47 EsZzH\" dir=\"auto\" id=\"viewer-di7pr183\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"HWr-d\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700\"><span>Grant Management Associates has years of experience with opportunities like this one. </span></strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:cwinter@grantmanagementassoc.com\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"PEY94 _4dQlf\" data-hook=\"web-link\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700\"><span style=\"color:#787878;text-decoration:inherit\"><span>Contact us</span></span></strong></a><strong style=\"font-weight:700\"><span>&nbsp;today for a consultation.</span></strong></span></p></div><div type=\"paragraph\" data-hook=\"rcv-block30\"></div></div><div type=\"last\" data-hook=\"rcv-block-last\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
