    "title": "CCA California Clean Air Day Grant Program - Due 07/12/24",
    "excerpt": "California Clean Air Day 2024 Microgrant Application Funder/Agency: Coalition for Clean Air (CCA) Description: Funding of up to $1,000 is available to make California Clean Air Day a success in your c...",
    "bodyText": "\nSearch\n\nOpportunity Title:\n\nCalifornia Clean Air Day 2024 Microgrant Application\n\n \n\nFunder/Agency:\n\nCoalition for Clean Air (CCA)\n\n\n\n\nDescription:\n\nFunding of up to $1,000 is available to make California Clean Air Day a success in your community. Please complete this grant application for potential funding for your local event or activity. To be eligible for funding, the local project must occur on or within the seven days prior to California Clean Air Day on October 2, 2024.\n\nThe local project must:\n\nRaise awareness of Clean Air Day\n\nContribute to cleaning the air or encourage participants to take actions that will clean the air and\n\nSuccessfully engage at least 100 participants/attendees.\n\n\n\n\nExamples of uses of the funds include supplies for events (food, tables & chairs, refreshments), marketing expenses, city permit costs, materials for activities (shovels/tools, giveaways, educational materials), etc.\n\n \n\nAward Details: \n\nMaximum Award:\n\n$1,000\n\n \n\nDeadline:\n\nApplications Due July 12, 2024\n\n \n\nOpportunity Link\n\n \n\nGrant Management Associates has years of experience with opportunities like this one. Contact us today for a consultation.\n\nOpportunity Title: FY24 Bipartisan Infrastructure Law National Estuarine Research Reserve System Habitat Protection and Restoration...\n\nOpportunity Title: Composting and Food Waste Reduction (CFWR) Pilot Project Funder/Agency: Department of Agriculture (USDA), Natural...\n\nOpportunity Title: Bipartisan Infrastructure Law (BIL) - Clean Fuels & Products Shot: Supporting Carbon Utilization Products via...\n\n",
