    "title": "USDA Rural Community Development Initiative (RCDI) - Due 07/10/24",
    "excerpt": "Rural Community Development Initiative (RCDI) Funder/Agency: Department of Agriculture (USDA), Rural Housing Service (RHS) Opportunity Number: USDA-RD-HCFP-RCDI-2024 Description: The program is design...",
    "bodyText": "\nSearch\n\nOpportunity Title:\n\nRural Community Development Initiative (RCDI)\n\n \n\nFunder/Agency:\n\nDepartment of Agriculture (USDA), Rural Housing Service (RHS)\n\n \n\nOpportunity Number:\n\nUSDA-RD-HCFP-RCDI-2024\n\n \n\nDescription:\n\nThe program is designed to assist qualified private organizations, nonprofit organizations, and public (including Tribal) intermediary organizations, proposing to carry out financial and technical assistance programs to improve housing, community facilities, and community and economic development projects in rural areas. The RCDI program requires the intermediary (Grantee) to provide a program of financial and technical assistance to recipients. The recipients will, in turn, provide programs to their communities (beneficiaries).\n\n\n\n\nEligibility:\n\nState and local governmental entities\n\nSmall businesses\n\nFor profit organizations other than small businesses\n\nNonprofits\n\nNative American tribal governments (Federally recognized)\n\nNative American tribal organizations (other than Federally recognized tribal governments)\n\nPublic and State controlled institutions of higher education\n\nPrivate institutions of higher education\n\nIndependent school districts\n\nPublic housing authorities/Indian housing authorities\n\n \n\nAward Details:\n\nTotal Amount Available:\n\n$5,000,000\n\n \n\nMaximum Award:\n\n$500,000\n\n \n\nMinimum Award:\n\n$50,000\n\n \n\nDeadline:\n\nApplications Due July 10, 2024\n\n \n\nOpportunity Link\n\n \n\nGrant Management Associates has years of experience with opportunities like this one. Contact us today for a consultation.\n\nOpportunity Title: Rural Energy for America Program (REAP) Funder/Agency: USDA Renewable Energy Systems & Energy Efficiency Improvement...\n\nOpportunity Title: Small Business Innovation Research and Small Business Technology Transfer Programs Phase I Funder/Agency: Department...\n\nOpportunity Title: Agrivoltaics Research and Demonstration Funder/Agency: New York State Energy Research and Development Authority...\n\n",
