    "title": "USDA Organic Certification Cost Share Programs - Due 07/12/24",
    "excerpt": "Organic Certification Cost Share Programs Funder/Agency: Department of Agriculture (USDA), Farm Service Agency (FSA) Opportunity Number: USDA-FSA-SND-NOCCSP-24-NOFO0001411 Description: The U.S. Depart...",
    "bodyText": "\nSearch\n\nOpportunity Title:\n\nOrganic Certification Cost Share Programs\n\n\n\n\nFunder/Agency:\n\nDepartment of Agriculture (USDA), Farm Service Agency (FSA)\n\n\n\n\nOpportunity Number:\n\nUSDA-FSA-SND-NOCCSP-24-NOFO0001411\n\n \n\nDescription:\n\nThe U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA), Farm Service Agency (FSA), requests applications for the National Organic Certification Cost Share Program (NOCCSP) and the Agricultural Management Assistance (AMA) Organic Certification Cost Share Program, collectively referred to as the OCCSP, for fiscal year (FY) 2024.\n\n\n\n\nThe purpose of the OCCSP awards is to defray the costs of receiving and maintaining organic certification.\n\n \n\nEligibility:\n\nState governments\n\n\n\n\nAward Details:\n\nTotal Amount Available:\n\n$5,700,000\n\n \n\nMaximum Award:\n\n$2,030,300\n\n\n\n\nMinimum Award:\n\n$3,000\n\n \n\nDeadline:\n\nApplications Due July 12, 2024\n\n \n\nOpportunity Link\n\n \n\nGrant Management Associates has years of experience with opportunities like this one. Contact us today for a consultation.\n\nOpportunity Title: Rural Energy for America Program (REAP) Funder/Agency: USDA Renewable Energy Systems & Energy Efficiency Improvement...\n\nOpportunity Title: Small Business Innovation Research and Small Business Technology Transfer Programs Phase I Funder/Agency: Department...\n\nOpportunity Title: Agrivoltaics Research and Demonstration Funder/Agency: New York State Energy Research and Development Authority...\n\n",
    "category": "Agriculture"
