    "excerpt": "Residential Energy Services Providers (4902) Funder/Agency: New York State Energy Re and Development Authority (NYSERDA) Opportunity Number: 4902 Description: The New York State Energy Re and Developm...",
    "bodyText": "\n\nSearch\n\nOpportunity Title:\n\nResidential Energy Services Providers (4902)\n\n \n\nFunder/Agency:\n\nNew York State Energy Research and Development Authority (NYSERDA)\n\n \n\nOpportunity Number:\n\n4902\n\n \n\nDescription:\n\nThe New York State Energy Research and Development Authority (NYSERDA) is issuing this Request for Qualifications (RFQL) 4902 to establish a pool of contractors who have expertise in one or more areas of residential energy efficiency and clean energy. NYSERDA is seeking qualified applicants in the following areas:\n\nCategory A: Market Development and Implementation Services\n\nCategory B: Residential Services Providers\n\nCategory C: Technical Support, Analysis, and Tool Development\n\nCategory D: Housing and Policy Expertise\n\n \n\nAward Details:\n\nTotal Amount Available:\n\n$2,000,000,000\n\n\n\n\nDeadline:\n\nRound 6 Applications Ongoing Until Due July 18, 2024\n\nRound 7 Applications Ongoing Until Due December 23, 2024\n\n \n\nOpportunity Link\n\n \n\nGrant Management Associates has years of experience with opportunities like this one. Contact us today for a consultation.\n\nOpportunity Title: Rural Energy for America Program (REAP) Funder/Agency: USDA Renewable Energy Systems & Energy Efficiency Improvement...\n\nOpportunity Title: Technology Commercialization Fund Open Voucher Call Funder/Agency: Department of Energy (DOE), Office of Technology...\n\nOpportunity Title: Military Electric Vehicle (EV) Chargers Funder/Agency: California Energy Commission (CEC) Opportunity Number:...\n\n",
