    "slug": "cec-clean-dispatchable-generation-due-09-13-workshop-06-06",
    "title": "CEC Clean, Dispatchable Generation - Due 09/13; Workshop 06/06",
    "excerpt": "Clean, Dispatchable Generation Funder/Agency: California Energy Commission (CEC) Opportunity Number: GFO-23-315 Description: The purposes of this solicitation are to support the adoption of clean, dis...",
    "bodyText": "\nSearch\n\nOpportunity Title:\n\nClean, Dispatchable Generation\n\n \n\nFunder/Agency:\n\nCalifornia Energy Commission (CEC)\n\n \n\nOpportunity Number:\n\nGFO-23-315\n\n \n\nDescription:\n\nThe purposes of this solicitation are to support the adoption of clean, dispatchable generation in California and reduce the reliance on fossil-based technologies while providing reliable power for critical infrastructure. By deploying clean, dispatchable generation technologies and producing hydrogen for electricity generation, this solicitation can benefit California's communities, workforce, air quality, and natural environments.\n\n\n\n\nPre-Application Workshop\n\nCEC staff will hold one Pre-Application Workshop to discuss this solicitation with potential applicants. Participation is optional but encouraged.\n\n\n\n\nThursday, June 6, 2024 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM\n\n\n\n\nTo join the Zoom meeting and enter the Meeting ID below and select “join from your browser.” Participants will then enter the meeting password listed below and their name. Participants will select the “Join” button:\n\nMeeting ID: 826 7501 5623\n\nMeeting Password: energy\n\n\n\n\nTelephone Access Only:\n\nCall 1-888 475 4499 (Toll Free) or 1-877 853 5257 (Toll Free). When prompted, enter the meeting number above. International callers may select a number from the Zoom International Dial-in Number List. To comment, dial *9 to “raise your hand” and *6 to mute/unmute your phone line.\n\n \n\nAward Details:\n\nTotal Amount Available:\n\n$8,000,000\n\n \n\nMaximum Award:\n\n$4,000,000\n\n \n\nMinimum Award:\n\n$2,000,000\n\n \n\nDeadline:\n\nQuestions Due June 14, 2024\n\nApplications Due September 13, 2024\n\n \n\nOpportunity Link\n\n \n\nGrant Management Associates has years of experience with opportunities like this one. Contact us today for a consultation.\n\nOpportunity Title: Rural Energy for America Program (REAP) Funder/Agency: USDA Renewable Energy Systems & Energy Efficiency Improvement...\n\nOpportunity Title: Technology Commercialization Fund Open Voucher Call Funder/Agency: Department of Energy (DOE), Office of Technology...\n\nOpportunity Title: Military Electric Vehicle (EV) Chargers Funder/Agency: California Energy Commission (CEC) Opportunity Number:...\n\n",
